  (text "MostlyLevel rev A (draft) - GPIO map matches ES3C28P so firmware runs unchanged.\nJ2: QD2833 panel FPC soldered (18 x 0.4x4.5 mm pads, 0.8 mm). Pads copied from vendor footprint QD-TFT2803; matches panel drawing (bent FPC 17.46 mm from panel edge).\nJ3: 6P 0.5 mm FPC, pad geometry and pin-1 side copied from vendor footprint P6. Check XUNPU FPC-05F-6PH20 datasheet land pattern during layout.\nIO45 (backlight) and IO46 (LCD DC) are strapping pins: R5 keeps IO45 low at boot; keep IO46 low at reset.\nIO35-37 are used by the N16R8 octal PSRAM - do not use."
    (at 20.32 256.54 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "21e6b9bd-771d-44f9-9c93-fea619ffa83d")
  )
